Modifications
-------------
The only modification is mechanical: every import of an upstream module `TauCeti.X` was
rewritten to `SharpSymmetricLSI.Vendor.TauCeti.X`, and the files were placed at the
corresponding paths under this directory. File contents are otherwise byte-identical to
upstream; declaration names and namespaces are unchanged.

Selection
---------
